    {
      "name": "Error Reference",
      "description": "Reference folder — not actual requests. Documents all error codes returned by the API.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "All Error Codes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "http://localhost:5000/", "host": ["http://localhost:5000"], "path": [""] },
            "description": "## All Error Codes\n\n| Code | HTTP | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|\n| `VALIDATION_ERROR` | 400 | Zod validation failed — includes `details` array with field-level messages |\n| `INVALID_CREDENTIALS` | 401 | Wrong bankUserId or password |\n| `ACCOUNT_LOCKED` | 401 | 5 failed login attempts — includes `remainingSeconds` in `error.details` |\n| `ACCOUNT_INACTIVE` | 400 | User account is deactivated (`isActive: false`) |\n| `ACCOUNT_FROZEN` | 403 | Bank account status is not active |\n| `ACCOUNT_NOT_OWNED` | 403 | Source account does not belong to the logged-in user (debit/transfer) |\n| `TOKEN_EXPIRED` | 401 | JWT access or refresh token has expired |\n| `TOKEN_INVALID` | 401 | JWT is malformed or signature mismatch |\n| `TOKEN_REUSE_DETECTED` | 401 | Refresh token family compromise — all sessions revoked |\n| `MUST_CHANGE_PASSWORD` | 403 | Temporary password must be changed — only `/profile/password` is accessible |\n| `FORBIDDEN` | 403 | Valid token but insufficient role |\n| `USER_NOT_FOUND` | 404 | No user with given id or bankUserId |\n| `ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND` | 404 | No account with given account number |\n| `EMAIL_EXISTS` | 409 | Email already registered |\n| `NATIONAL_ID_EXISTS` | 409 | National ID already registered |\n| `INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS` | 400 | Balance would go negative — no overdraft allowed |\n| `CURRENCY_MISMATCH` | 400 | Transfer between accounts of different currencies |\n| `SAME_ACCOUNT` | 400 | Transfer source and destination are the same account |\n| `CANNOT_DELETE_ADMIN` | 409 | Cannot delete the last admin account |\n| `INVALID_CURRENT_PASSWORD` | 401 | Wrong current password on password change |\n| `INTERNAL_ERROR` | 500 | Unexpected server error |"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
